{{wikipedia}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[great]] [[white]] [[shark]]}}

# A large [[shark]], ''[[Carcharodon carcharias]]'', of coastal surface waters in all major oceans that feeds on [[fish]] and marine [[mammal]]s.

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|great white shark}}, {{l|en|great white}}, {{l|en|white pointer}}

